==Strategy==
Unlike in [[The Farthest Point]], there's only a single Bakoo here, and you have exactly 13.34 seconds to deal as much damage to Bakoo before Dark Dober shows up. Save up enough to afford [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]], then kill Mooth with [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to get some cash and start chaining Gobble with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. With good enough luck, he should completely brutalize Gobble, before moving on to Bakoo as soon as she spawns. Swarm Bakoo with Fishmen, [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]], and Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]]s, who will each work together to tear through her entire health bar in seconds. Beyond that point, cleanup isn't too bad: Newtone, [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], and Talented [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] get the job done.

